course: dictionary
lesson: 11139
title: The word wife
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: A wife is the woman a person is married to. If Sam is married to Priya, then Priya is Sam's wife and Sam is her husband. Husband and wife are partners in a marriage.
explain: Use the words around wife to check its meaning. «Grief usually gets softer with time: Oscar's grandad says that a year after his wife died the pain is «like a bruise that's healing»...» Grandad was married to the woman who died, so his wife must mean the woman he was married to.
explain: Wife also has an older meaning. In old stories and old phrases it can mean simply a woman, as in «old wives' tale». That phrase is a common belief that is not true, so it is not about married women at all.
fact: A wife is the woman a person is married to.
fact: A husband is the man a person is married to, so husband and wife are partners in a marriage.
fact: The plural of wife is wives.
fact: «Old wives' tale» means a common belief that is not true.
fact: When Odysseus came home, many men wanted to marry his wife Penelope, but he drove them out.
exercise: Odysseus came home and many men wanted to marry his wife Penelope. Who was Penelope to Odysseus? | A friend from his travels | A servant in his hall | *His wife | A sister
exercise: What is the plural of wife? | wivess | *wives | wifies | wifes
exercise: What does «old wives' tale» mean? | A story about old women | A tale told by a wife | A true story from long ago | *A common belief that is not true
test: «Joseph refused to do wrong with his master Potiphar's wife.» Who was Potiphar's wife? | A sister of Joseph | *The woman married to Potiphar | A judge in the city | A cook in the house
test: Oscar's grandad says, «a year after his wife died the pain is like a bruise that's healing». Who is Oscar's grandad's wife? | Oscar's aunt | *Oscar's grandma | Oscar's cousin | Oscar's teacher
exam: Which word is the partner of wife in a marriage? | daughter | sister | *husband | friend
